-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §51 קרן רווחה: from 1.1.2011 a yearly sum
-- of 7 million shekels, 13.5 million from 1.1.2012, is allocated to the
-- welfare of teaching employees, updated by the Government's procurement
-- coefficient; the organisation sets up a welfare fund and runs it in a
-- separate account; the budget reaches it through the Ministry every
-- January; the organisation reports on it every year; and if a lawful way
-- is found to pay the employer's pension contribution for a sabbatical year
-- other than out of the training fund, the budget goes to that from an
-- agreed day, updated thereafter as the teachers' wage supplements are.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `51 קרן רווחה`

DECLARE `Oz section 51 action` IS ONE OF
    `set up the welfare fund and run it in a separate account`
    `send the Ministry's accountant the welfare fund's financial reports`
    `send the wages commissioner a copy of the welfare fund's reports`

§§ `51(א)`

-- (א): from 1.1.2011 a yearly sum of 7 million is allocated for the welfare
-- of teaching employees; from 1.1.2012 the yearly sum grows to 13.5
-- million. Years are calendar years (from 1 January); before 2011 §51
-- allocates nothing. The sums are as signed; (ב) updates them.
@ref akn:art_51__para_a
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc a calendar year
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the yearly welfare budget section 51 allocates, as signed, for` y IS
    BRANCH
        IF y AT LEAST 2012 THEN JUST 13_500_000
        IF y AT LEAST 2011 THEN JUST 7_000_000
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

§§ `51(ב)`

-- (ב): the budget is updated by the updates to the Government's procurement
-- coefficient ("מקדם הקניות של הממשלה"), which are set elsewhere: the
-- coefficient's movement since the signed sum is a fact of the case
-- (convention amounts.inputs), and the sum moves by it exactly (convention
-- rounding.default). From the day (ו) agrees on, (ב) no longer applies.
@ref akn:art_51__para_b
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      `the procurement coefficient's movement` IS A NUMBER @desc the coefficient as updated, divided by what it was when the sum was signed; 1 if it has not moved
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a welfare budget updated by the procurement coefficient` amount `the procurement coefficient's movement` IS
    amount TIMES `the procurement coefficient's movement`

`why the Government's procurement coefficient is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "מקדם הקניות של הממשלה ועדכוניו"

§§ `51(ג)`

-- (ג): the organisation sets up a fund it runs itself, in a separate
-- account, for the welfare of teaching employees — "כגון" culture, health,
-- holidays and leisure, an open list (convention reading.closed-list) —
-- "the welfare fund". No day is set (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_51__para_c
`setting up the welfare fund` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    MUST  `set up the welfare fund and run it in a separate account`

DECLARE `purpose of the welfare fund` IS ONE OF
    `the teachers' culture`
    `the teachers' health`
    `the teachers' holidays`
    `the teachers' leisure`
    `another part of the teachers' welfare`

§§ `51(ד)`

-- (ד): the budget is transferred to the welfare fund through the Ministry
-- of Education, in January of every year. "יועבר" names no one to transfer
-- it (the money passes through the Ministry), so the encoding writes the
-- month and no duty. Months are counted as `the Oz salary month` counts
-- them.
--
-- F-oz-founding-51-a: (א) allocates a sum for 2011, from 1.1.2011, and
-- the agreement was signed on 14.8.2011, so January 2011 — the month (ד)
-- gives that year's transfer — was over before there was a duty to make
-- it. The reading adopted (convention dates.no-deadline): 2011's sum is
-- transferred with no deadline; from 2012 each year's in its January.
@ref akn:art_51__para_d
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc a calendar year
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the month section 51(ד) transfers the budget of` y IS
    IF y AT LEAST 2012
    THEN JUST (`the Oz salary month` y 1)
    ELSE NOTHING

`the month the Oz agreement was signed` MEANS `the Oz salary month` 2011 8

`the month (ד)'s words give 2011's transfer` MEANS `the Oz salary month` 2011 1

§§ `51(ה)`

-- (ה): once a year the organisation sends the Ministry of Education's
-- accountant the welfare fund's financial reports, with full detail of what
-- the fund did in the year before the report and of the money spent on
-- it; and sends a copy to the wages commissioner at the Treasury. "אחת
-- לשנה" sets no day within the year (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_51__para_e
`reporting on the welfare fund` MEANS
    (PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
     MUST  `send the Ministry's accountant the welfare fund's financial reports`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
     MUST  `send the wages commissioner a copy of the welfare fund's reports`)

§§ `51(ו)`

-- (ו): the organisation asks that the employer's contribution to a pension
-- provident fund for a teacher's sabbatical year be paid other than out of
-- the money in the training fund. If a way to meet it is found within the
-- law, then from a day the parties agree: the transfers to the welfare fund
-- stop (and what was transferred for the time after that day is returned);
-- the yearly budget of (א) serves the demand; (ב) no longer applies; and
-- the budget is updated at the rates and on the dates of the wage
-- supplements that apply to all teaching employees. Each of these holds
-- from the agreed day on (convention dates.start).
@ref akn:art_51__para_f
DECLARE `what section 51's budget serves` IS ONE OF
    `the welfare fund`
    `the employer's pension contribution for a sabbatical year`

DECLARE `how section 51's budget is updated` IS ONE OF
    `by the Government's procurement coefficient`
    `at the rates and dates of the wage supplements of all teaching employees`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the agreed day` IS A MAYBE DATE @desc the day the parties agreed, once a lawful way to meet the demand was found; NOTHING until then
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 51(ו) has turned the budget by` d `the agreed day` IF
    CONSIDER `the agreed day`
    WHEN JUST a THEN d `is on or after` a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the agreed day` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `what section 51's budget serves`
DECIDE `what section 51's budget serves on` d `the agreed day` IS
    IF `section 51(ו) has turned the budget by` d `the agreed day`
    THEN `the employer's pension contribution for a sabbatical year`
    ELSE `the welfare fund`

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the agreed day` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `how section 51's budget is updated`
DECIDE `how section 51's budget is updated on` d `the agreed day` IS
    IF `section 51(ו) has turned the budget by` d `the agreed day`
    THEN `at the rates and dates of the wage supplements of all teaching employees`
    ELSE `by the Government's procurement coefficient`

-- What the welfare fund returns: what was transferred to it for the time
-- after the agreed day, "ככל שהועבר".
GIVEN `transferred for the time after the agreed day` IS A NUMBER
      `the agreed day` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `what the welfare fund returns under section 51(ו)` `transferred for the time after the agreed day` `the agreed day` IS
    CONSIDER `the agreed day`
    WHEN JUST a THEN `transferred for the time after the agreed day`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

§§ `51 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the yearly welfare budget section 51 allocates, as signed, for` 2011 EQUALS JUST 7_000_000
#ASSERT `the yearly welfare budget section 51 allocates, as signed, for` 2012 EQUALS JUST 13_500_000
#ASSERT `the yearly welfare budget section 51 allocates, as signed, for` 2010 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a welfare budget updated by the procurement coefficient` 13_500_000 1.02 EQUALS 13_770_000
#ASSERT `the month section 51(ד) transfers the budget of` 2013 EQUALS JUST (`the Oz salary month` 2013 1)
#ASSERT `what section 51's budget serves on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014) NOTHING EQUALS `the welfare fund`
#ASSERT `what section 51's budget serves on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014) (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)) EQUALS `the employer's pension contribution for a sabbatical year`
#ASSERT `how section 51's budget is updated on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2013) (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)) EQUALS `by the Government's procurement coefficient`
#ASSERT `what the welfare fund returns under section 51(ו)` 4_000_000 NOTHING EQUALS 0

-- F-oz-founding-51-a's evidence: (א) allocates a sum for 2011, and the
-- January (ד) gives its transfer is before the month of the signing.
`section 51(ד) puts 2011's transfer before the signing` MEANS
        `the yearly welfare budget section 51 allocates, as signed, for` 2011 EQUALS JUST 7_000_000
    AND `the month (ד)'s words give 2011's transfer` LESS THAN `the month the Oz agreement was signed`
#ASSERT `section 51(ד) puts 2011's transfer before the signing`
